{"id":8834723807431,"title":"Custom Cardinals on Flowering Branches Quilt with Name","handle":"custom-cardinals-on-flowering-branches-quilt-47d5316f3d-47d5316f3d","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the beauty of winter nature into your home with this beautiful quilt from Jeminise. Featuring a realistic patchwork design of Christmas couple red birds on flowering branches, this cozy bedding layer is perfect for adding a touch of holiday warmth or weekday comfort to your bedroom or guest room.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustom Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Easily personalize your quilt by adding your custom name or text and choosing your preferred size or optional matching pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Cozy Feel:\u003c\/strong\u003e The outer layer is made of breathable, soft polyester fabric filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, all-season warmth.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect for indoor and outdoor activities, including bed bedding, sofa lounging, backyard relaxation, picnics, or camping.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from 5 versatile sizes to fit your needs: Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comes as a single quilt with the option to add matching pillowcases (20x30 inches) to complete your custom bedding set.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat or air-dry cycle to stay soft and fluffy.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\